@LMAPI_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136

### Get device details by device ID
GET {{LMAPI_HostAddress}}/api/devices/42
Accept: application/json

###

### Get events/logs for a device (last 50, no filter)
GET {{LMAPI_HostAddress}}/api/devices/42/events?size=50&offset=0
Accept: application/json

###

### Get events/logs for a device filtered by severity
GET {{LMAPI_HostAddress}}/api/devices/42/events?filter=severity:"error"&size=50&offset=0
Accept: application/json

###

### Get active alerts for a device (critical only: severity=2)
GET {{LMAPI_HostAddress}}/api/devices/42/alerts?filter=severity:2&size=50&offset=0
Accept: application/json

###

### Search LM Logs for a specific device
GET {{LMAPI_HostAddress}}/api/logs/events?filter=_lm.resourceId.system.deviceId:"42"&size=50&offset=0
Accept: application/json

###
